{
  "slug": "conversiontools",
  "name": "Conversiontools",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Convert files between 140+ formats directly from Claude Code. Documents (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, PDF), data formats (JSON, CSV, XML, YAML, Parquet), images (PNG, JPG, WebP, AVIF, HEIC, SVG), audio, video, e-books, OCR text extraction, AI text-to-speech, AI speech-to-text transcription, and AI-powered data extraction. Powered by the ConversionTools.io API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `convert` (Convert files between 140+ formats using Conversion Tools), `parse-integration` (Extract structured data from documents (invoices, receipts, purchase orders, bills of lading, bank statements, contracts, forms, ID documents,…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `conversiontools`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install conversiontools@claude-community` from `conversiontools/agent-skills`.",
